'''Yellow Strike''' (イエローパワー, ''Ierō Pawā'', '''Yellow Power''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]].

==Effect==
"Immune to Waves": [[:Category:Nyanko Rangers|Nyanko Rangers]] gain [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]].

